    "v2_flexible_Xgp6a3": {
      "type": "v2_flexible",
      "blocks": {
        "headline_wnFRw9": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Suitability & Prerequisites </p>",
            "heading_align": "center",
            "heading_width": "mediumplus",
            "heading_type": "h2",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": false,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "subheadline_6JqwEm": {
          "type": "subheadline",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Join thousands of successful graduates who transformed their careers with our award-winning training programs.</p>",
            "text_align": "center",
            "text_width": "mediumplus",
            "text_size": "copy-xl",
            "text_no_decal": false,
            "text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 40,
            "margin_bottom": 40
          }
        },
        "headline_EWAa9a": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Step 4: Start earning</p>",
            "heading_align": "left",
            "heading_width": "full",
            "heading_type": "h1",
            "heading_size": "hero",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": true,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "boxcol_ebdVaB": {
          "type": "boxcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_heading_text": "<p><strong>Who Is This Course For?</strong></p>",
            "left_heading_type": "h3",
            "left_heading_size": "copy-xl",
            "left_heading_no_decal": true,
            "left_heading_decal_left": false,
            "left_heading_strong_accented": false,
            "left_text": "<p>This diploma is ideal for aspiring fitness professionals – whether you’re an exercise enthusiast looking to go pro, or someone seeking a career change into personal training. It’s designed for beginners and those who want all-in-one training to become a Gym Instructor and Personal Trainer.</p><ul><li>for fitness-enthusiast <strong>beginners</strong></li><li><strong>All-in-one</strong> training</li></ul>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-m",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_heading_text": "<p><strong>Entry Requirements: No prior qualifications required</strong></p>",
            "right_heading_type": "h3",
            "right_heading_size": "copy-xl",
            "right_heading_no_decal": true,
            "right_heading_decal_left": false,
            "right_heading_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p>You must be 16+ years old, with a basic level of fitness and a passion for health and exercise. No experience? No problem – the course includes the foundational Level 2 Gym Instructing certification to get you up to speed.</p><ul><li>Must be<strong> 16+</strong></li><li><strong>No experience</strong> needed</li></ul>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-m",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 80,
            "margin_bottom": 80
          }
        },
        "headline_Xxe9QB": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Step 4: Start earning</p>",
            "heading_align": "left",
            "heading_width": "full",
            "heading_type": "h2",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": true,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "textcol_HNmjwr": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p>Once you’re qualified, we don’t leave you hanging. As one of the UK’s top-rated training providers, <strong>we’ve built partnerships with leading gyms across the country</strong> — including The Gym Group, Virgin Active, and more. <strong>Learners get access to guaranteed job interviews</strong>, giving you a clear pathway into paid employment, check out our <a href=\"/pages/careers\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Careers\">Career Support page</a> to learn more.</p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-m",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": true,
            "right_text": "<p>Want a career that <strong>pays well, fits around your life, and doesn’t require a university<br/> degree</strong>? Becoming a Wellness Personal Trainer opens the door to flexible, rewarding<br/> jobs that <strong>keep you active, fulfilled, and in control of your time</strong>. Whether you want to work in gyms, run sessions in the community, coach clients online,<br/> or build your own wellness brand, it all starts here.</p>",
